; Explicit development prerequisite only; not production enrollment policy.
; Reversible module: greyward_session_bus_boundary. No new allow rules.
; The existing ordinary role closure includes the session/a11y bus domains.
; Deny attach-mode inspection (mem, ptrace, process_vm_* and pidfd_getfd),
; preserving process metadata, dbus send_msg, sockets and client FD passing.
; This does not attest startup, revoke held descriptors, protect portal/proxy
; processes, or authenticate a request forwarded through the session bus.
(deny greyward_as_ordinary greyward_guard_dbusd_t (process (ptrace)))
(neverallow greyward_as_ordinary greyward_guard_dbusd_t (process (ptrace)))
